window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Emily Rochester rebuilds her life after being on the run. Her husband is gone. Her daughter is safe. The nightmare is behind her...except someone is watching.</p> <p>Mateo Garza is everything she doesn't want. Wealthy. Famous. Gorgeous.</p> <p>He's also the only man she trusts.</p> <p>HIDING PLACES is a spin-off full-length novel with Emily and Mateo from the Rochester trilogy--as well as plenty of scenes featuring Beau and Jane as they build their life together.</p>"; 
